==Trivia==
The dining room of the [[Old Chateau]]—where {{p|Gastly}} can be found in {{game|Diamond and Pearl|s|Pokémon Diamond, Pearl}}, {{game|Platinum||Platinum}}, {{game|Brilliant Diamond and Shining Pearl|s|Brilliant Diamond, and Shining Pearl}}—can be seen in the background of this card's standard illustration. This card is also featured in the {{TCGP|Triumphant Light}} expansion's "Rotom of the Old Chateau" [[Triumphant Light (TCG Pocket)#Themed Collections|Themed Collection]].

===Origin===
*{{m|Astonish}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Gastly}} can learn via [[breeding]].
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

